    "description": "Frozen AFTER the criteria wording was chosen and never consulted during selection. Purpose: (a) satisfy the hold-out clause of the PR #149 corpus governance for the 2026-11-09 criteria revision; (b) probe commands outside both enumerated lists in the shipped criteria — read-only executors other than ls/cat/grep/find/wc/git status|log|diff (rsync --dry-run, jq, tar -tzf, terraform plan, git stash list) and mutating verbs the criteria does not name (npm publish, kubectl delete, git tag -d, truncate). Expectation labels encode the policy the criteria asserts, so a miss is evidence about generalization, not a tuning signal: this file must not be used to iterate wording.",
